&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our &lt;strong&gt;Mirakl Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; team, led by &lt;strong&gt;Remi Takase, Senior Data Science Manager&lt;/strong&gt;. The team is part of a passionate and skilled data organisation of Data Scientists, Research Scientists, Data Engineers and SREs, building on a state-of-the-art Machine Learning and Data platform. The Mirakl Assistant team is a new team that runs like a start-up inside a scale-up. Together, you&#39;ll be designing, building and scaling the conversational AI assistant that changes how our users work across Mirakl products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The assistant knows the platform and the users, and helps them get the most out of Mirakl, from finding their way around the product, to understanding their business and growing it. We&#39;re taking it from conversational to action-oriented: users ask, and the assistant gets it done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI agents are fundamentally reshaping commerce software: what customers expect from it, how they interact with it, and how they integrate it into their business. At Mirakl, AI is a core part of our product strategy - from Catalog Transformer and content generation to AI Agents and Agentic Commerce. This is where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
